@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed durable message flow — logical lanes, backend not selected
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

database "Owned commit + pending intent" as DB
rectangle "Dispatcher\nCommitted work discovery" as D
queue "Interactive-independent job eligibility\nPDF / artifact processing" as Q1
queue "Provider operation eligibility\nReviewed send / selected sync" as Q2
queue "Reconciliation / cleanup eligibility\nUncertain attempts / safe lifecycle" as Q3
rectangle "Bounded rendering / storage workers" as W1
rectangle "Scoped provider workers" as W2
rectangle "Scoped reconciliation workers" as W3
database "Attempt observations / restricted outcomes" as O
DB --> D
D --> Q1
D --> Q2
D --> Q3
Q1 --> W1
Q2 --> W2
Q3 --> W3
W1 --> O
W2 --> O
W3 --> O
O ..> Q3 : unresolved effects become reconciliation work
legend bottom
 Lanes are job classes; they need not be distinct physical queues or brokers.
 Delivery / acknowledgment may duplicate and does not prove external completion.
 Exhausted / unknown work needs visible disposition, not blind redelivery or a fictitious dead-letter product.
endlegend
@enduml
